			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>The system Settings app can only store the 115 Cookie in UserDefaults temporarily. When you return to JavDB, the plugin immediately moves it into the Keychain (ThisDeviceOnly) and deletes the plaintext. The text field will look empty afterwards; that does not mean the cookie was lost. It will not be written back to UserDefaults or logs. Use the floating-button panel to confirm. The folder CID is stored in UserDefaults (not a secret).</string>
