		<dict>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>When on, native hooks may cancel identified in-house ad APIs (/api/v1/ads and /api/v1/ads/splash_log on jdforrepam.com / letidi.com) if they go through NSURLSession or WKWebView. For a short time after launch the plugin also tries to activate a Flutter splash-ad Skip control (跳过) via FlutterEngine ensureSemanticsEnabled. It does not skip SplashPage startup work (domain probe, update, local auth), hide the first window, or touch payment/auth. Home and magnet-page ads still use dart:io TLS and usually cannot be blocked. This has not been device-tested and does not claim the opening ad is removed. No AdMob/Unity/Pangle/GDT SDK was found.</string>
